OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThere will
OL,6,Fbe further heavy showers around this
OL,7,Fevening, perhaps accompanied by
OL,8,Fthunder. Some showers continuing
OL,9,Fovernight, but western counties should
OL,10,Fbecome mainly dry. A moderate
OL,11,Fnortherly breeze developing.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FQuite breezy and feeling
OL,14,Ffresher with some showers, these
OL,15,Fmostly light and moving away quite
OL,16,Fbriskly. Rather cloudy but a few sunny
OL,17,Fintervals.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
