OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRemaining
OL,6,Fon the cool side but a lot of dry
OL,7,Fweather, though with a few light
OL,8,Fshowers. Quite cloudy, best of any
OL,9,Fsunshine around the coasts.
